  "application_type_full": "Tree works: Trees in conservation areas/subject to TPOs",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The Tree Works that are carried shall not exceed the description of the Tree Works amounts as described in Section 7 of the Application Form that was submitted to the Council. \r\rReason: To ensure the preservation of the amenity value and health of the tree(s).\r",
    "All tree works will be carried out in accordance with British Standard 3998: 2010 Tree work. Recommendations. In order to carry out the tree works to BS 3998:2010 there will be only the removal of secondary and tertiary branches, no primary branches. All final\rpruning cuts on the branches will not exceed a third of the diameter of the main stem of the tree when measured at 1.5 meters above ground level. \r\rReason: To ensure that the works are carried out in accordance with good arboricultural practice.\r",
    "This decision notice for Tree Works is only valid for 2 years from the date of this decision or until the work is completed, whichever is the sooner. \r\rReason: In order to ensure that the work is carried out whilst still appropriate and in accordance with the time period within the legislation and regulations."
  ],
